{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます⏾⋆˙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮城県出身20歳\n四期生の山川宇衣（やまかわうい）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "突然ですがみなさん、\n一昨日は何の日だったでしょう？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろん、森田さんのお誕生日🍰🌱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と、もうひとつ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月10日、”納豆の日”です🫘"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂きっての納豆好き（うい調べ）の春に\n納豆の日の話をしたら、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「じゃあ10月2日は”豆腐の日”だね」\nって教えてもらいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なるほど…！！たしかに！\n（忘れないようにすぐカレンダーに追加しました🗒️）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも、その後の調べによると、\nどうやら10月2日に限らず毎月12日は豆腐の日らしいです…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それはちょっぴり欲張りなのでは…？\nとも思いつつ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "豆腐好きなわたしは、”豆腐の日”をいいことに\n毎月12日はちょっと贅沢に豆腐を食べる日にしようと思います💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "考えてみれば、\nこの手の”〇〇の日”には色々あって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "例えば\nにくの日、いちごの日、ポッキーの日、いい夫婦の日…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パッと思いつくだけでもたくさんあるけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一番に”猫の日”が浮かんだのは\nわたしが 猫の日好き だからですか？🐾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫の日ってほんとうにかわいいです。\n響きがかわいい。存在がかわいい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うーん、やっぱりこれ\n年に1日だけなのはもったいないなぁ、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "…そういえば、7月4日は“名無しの日”ですね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫の日といえば2月だけど、\nいっそのこと7月4日も猫の日にしちゃいませんか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫の日が年に2日あったっていいと思う。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ね、そうしましょ？( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🐈‍⬛\\ ｻﾝｾｲ! /"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7/4 ミート＆グリート"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob3J0utw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会いにきてくれたみなさま、ありがとうございました🐾♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日のちょうど前日に、\nここ最近で一番くらいにわたしの心を動かしてくれた可愛すぎる和菓子たちに出会って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このあまりにもかわいい肉球のまんじゅうに釣られて耳を生やしてみました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめだけのつもりが、\n結局ほとんど一日中 耳残したままだったな🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobB7CR0m.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "^. .^ ੭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "肉球のほかにもいくつか手に取った和菓子たちの中に星型の最中があったのだけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobPMOSIE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（これ）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょうど先週のミーグリは七夕のすぐ近くでしたね💫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「七夕なにお願いする？」って聞いてくれたひとも何人かいて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしもこの星型のお菓子、七夕を意識して持っていったと思われたかもしれないのだけど、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ｷﾂﾞｲﾃﾅｶｯﾀ…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしの地元では毎年8月に”七夕まつり”があるので、なんとなく七夕といえば8月のイメージがあって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実はあまり意識していなかったのです…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうだよね、7月7日！七夕でした\nわたしの中ではすっかり猫の日気分だった🤧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と、すっかり猫の和菓子に浮かれていたわたしですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここらで恒例のあの質問を。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんは犬と猫、どっち派ですか？🐶🐱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろんわたしは、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "犬派です🐶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え？\nって声が聞こえた気がする…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろんあまりにも選び難い2択なので\n強いて言うならのお話だけどね💦"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもどちらかを選ばなければならないとなったら、やっぱりわんちゃんが好きなのです…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "犬派なんかい と思ったみなさん、\nすみません…🤧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たしかこれと同じようなことを、前にも話したことがあったなぁ…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あれは今から5ヶ月前\n本当の猫の日、2月22日のこと。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "トークにだけこっそり送ったブログ、題して「猫の日」。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せっかくだからここでもお披露目しようかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆるゆるブログだけど、\nぜひ暇つぶしに読んでいってください〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobwy6mC6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobSSfObk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobQnlr0H.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˚‧︵‿☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーー୨୧ーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは🐾🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の山川字衣（やまかわうい）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は待ちに待った猫の日🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで、ついついブログを書き始めてしまいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せっかくの猫の日にこんな話をしたら\n猫から反感を買ってしまうかもしれないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "犬派のわたしからしたら、猫の日があるのに犬の日を聞かないのは何でだろうと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな不満や理由を考えずにはいられないところで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝手に犬の日を作るとしたらいつになるかなって考えてみたのだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まず候補を挙げると、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1月1日 / 1月11日 / 11月1日 / 11月11日の4択になりそうですね💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも、1月1日は元旦だし、\n11月11日には「ポッキーの日」と名前がついているし..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "となると、1月11日か11月1日の2択になりますね..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でももしかしたら、それぞれもう名前がついているかもしれないので試しに調べてみたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1月11日は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鏡開き、蔵開き、塩の日、アルミの日、シャー芯の日、めんの日、マカロニサラダの日..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふむふむ、色々ありますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それじゃあ11月1日は"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ラジオ体操の日、灯台記念日、ダーツの日、すしい日、紅茶の日、犬の日..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "…犬の日！？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと、、わたしとしたことが、、、\n犬の日、あるらしいです、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はわたしの中で\n「猫の日」改め「犬の日発見記念日」です🐶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は猫の日！と言いながら\n犬の日の話ばかりしてしまいましたが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここまで読んで、心の中で\nあれ...？と思った方がいらっしゃるかもしれません"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜならわたしがすこし前に\n猫にきゅんとしたエピソードとともに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫かわいいだの、ツンデレに弱いだのと、\n猫への愛を熱く語った日があったから。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それなのに犬派だとか犬の日だとか、\nこれじゃあ犬派の端くれにも置けません。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そもそも前回のブログ（#24通目「後ろ髪をひかれた」）を読んで、\n犬派だったんかい🐶と思った方もいたかもしれません..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かと思えば、しばらくはまっているホイップわんちゃんの話や写真が定期的に送られてきたり..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これでは犬と猫両方に浮気者だと思われても仕方ありません、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結局のところ、犬と猫どっちのがすきなのか\nこの際はっきり言わせていただくと、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなの決められません、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "😖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう浮気者だと思われてもいいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だってかわいいんだもの\n（ういを。）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何はともあれ、今日はせっかくの2月22日\n猫の日なので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫にツンデレされたい一日にします🐈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今年の11月1日は\nわんちゃんに甘やかされたい一日にします🐕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてこのブログを書きながら思い出したことがひとつ💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前に住んでいたお家の近所で\n散歩をしているとよく見かける猫ちゃんがいて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "姉と一緒に勝手に名前をつけて愛でていたのだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "名前、なんだと思いますか？( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気になる方はぜひ聞きに来てくださいな\nこっそり教えてあげるね🐾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこのあたりで🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね🐾🧶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーー୨୧ーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なつかしいね、覚えててくれた方もいるかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえば、最後に書いた”猫の名前”、\n思ったより聞かれなかったなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ予想してみて、\nでもたぶん当たらないと思う…( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリ、行ってみたいけど何話そうかなぁって考えてくださっている方がもしいたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは猫の名前でも聞きに来てみてくださいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特別な会話がなくたって、\nあなたに会えることがうれしいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつでも気軽に会いにきてね、待ってます🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobLdhX3x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobetPbWq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね🐾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うい　#41通目"}], "source": "official"}